What this license covers

This license covers MarioCraft's own work:

  - the installer, launcher and Prism setup (install.bat, install.sh, launcher/)
  - the files MarioCraft adds to sm64coopdx (src/pc/mariocraft/, and
    src/pc/network/packets/packet_mariocraft.c, in patches/sm64coopdx.patch)
  - MarioCraft's changes to SkyCraft (patches/skycraft.patch). SkyCraft itself
    is also MIT licensed: see licenses/SkyCraft-LICENSE.txt.

It does not cover sm64coopdx. sm64coopdx doesn't publish a license, so its code
(including the parts of its existing files that patches/sm64coopdx.patch changes
or shows as context) stays under its authors' terms. MarioCraft doesn't include
sm64coopdx: the installer downloads it from its own repository. See
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
